      "created_at": "2014-03-11T12:47:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The effects still occur.&nbsp;</p><p>When the crew member is played, it's \"End of Turn\" effect goes to the back of the effects queue... and since it is still technically the End of Turn, it gets to go last.&nbsp;</p><p>This is part of what makes The Chairman such a challenge.&nbsp;</p>",
